   ],
   "bar_max": 40,
   "text": "of India's 1,48,634 million units: 39,386 in Himachal. Highest of the states.",
   "sub": "Plants over 25 MW, generated in the state, not who owns or uses it. Not per person.",
   "vo": "That is thirty-nine thousand million units, the highest of any state."
  },
  {
