    ]
   },
   "as": "share",
   "unit": "%",
   "text": "of all of India's electricity: 42,534 of 18,24,214 million units. 93% of it was large hydro.",
   "sub": "Himachal's large hydro was 39,386 of its 42,534 million units.",
   "vo": "Of all the electricity generated in India, Himachal made two point three percent."
  },
  {
