   "bar_max": 40,
   "text": "is Jammu and Kashmir's share. Uttarakhand: 10.2%. Karnataka: 9.5%.",
   "sub": "Next after them: Madhya Pradesh, 5.1%.",
   "vo": "Jammu and Kashmir, Uttarakhand and Karnataka came next, each near ten percent."
